        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Return Invalid Inquiry"
          },
          "outcomes": {},
          "code": "FIN_AP_RETURN_INVALID_INQUIRY",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1777618768205",
          "id": "1780489721020",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1780489721021_1",
              "name": "returnValue",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "return {\n  agent_response: [\n    {\n      display_type: \"text\",\n      display_sequence: 1,\n      text:\n        \"I cannot process the request at this time. I can assist with detailed invoice inquiries.<br/>You can ask me questions such as:<br/><br/>'Show overdue invoices where exception exists.'<br/>'Show invoices with approval status Approved.'<br/>'List invoices with validation status Incomplete for supplier Vision Operations and Invoice Creation Date From past 7 days.'\"\n    },\n    {\n      display_type: \"canvas\",\n      display_sequence: 2,\n      canvas_content: \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n};"
            }
          ],
          "type": "RETURN"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "modelConfiguration": {
              "modelProperties": {
                "k": 0,
                "max_tokens": 32000,
                "p": 0.75
              },
              "code": "ORA_LLM_MODEL_PROVIDER_CERT_BASIC_LLAMA_3_3_70B",
              "model": "ORA_LLM_MODEL_GPT_OSS_120B",
              "modelName": "GPT OSS 120B (Basic)",
              "provider": "CERT_BASIC"
            },
            "name": "Route Invoice Request"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1780295778205"
          },
          "code": "FIN_AP_ROUTE_INVOICE_REQUEST",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1781081707990",
          "id": "1780294546466",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1780294546468_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Classify the user message into exactly one route.\n\nRoutes:\n- rejectedInvoices: user is asking for rejected invoices or invoices with rejected status\n- standardInvoices: user is asking to view, list, find, search, or ask about invoices, but not specifically rejected invoices\n- unsupportedInquiry: user is not asking an invoice inquiry\n\nReturn only valid JSON.\nDo not return explanations.\nDo not return markdown.\n\nOutput format:\n{\n  \"route\": \"rejectedInvoices\" | \"standardInvoices\" | \"unsupportedInquiry\"\n}\n\nRouting rules:\n- Route to rejectedInvoices only when the user explicitly asks for rejected invoices, rejected status, rejected state, or invoices that were rejected.\n- Route to standardInvoices only when the user asks to view, list, find, search, filter, check, or ask about invoices.\n- Route to unsupportedInquiry when the user request is not about invoices.\n- Do not classify unrelated requests as standardInvoices.\n\nExamples:\n\nUser message:\nShow rejected invoices\n\nOutput:\n{\n  \"route\": \"rejectedInvoices\"\n}\n\nUser message:\nShow me all invoices\n\nOutput:\n{\n  \"route\": \"standardInvoices\"\n}\n\nUser message:\nShow invoice 12345\n\nOutput:\n{\n  \"route\": \"standardInvoices\"\n}\n\nUser message:\nShow overdue invoices\n\nOutput:\n{\n  \"route\": \"standardInvoices\"\n}\n\nNow classify the actual user message.\n\nUser message:\n{{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "businessObjectCode": "ORA_FIN_PAYABLES_BUSINESSOBJECTDATAEXTRACT_26B_CWB",
            "functionName": "Extract",
